 "<div class=\"caphud\"><div class=\"en\">So, any thoughts on the baseline?</div><div class=\"zh\" style=\"color:#bbb\">那么，对基线有什么看法？</div></div><div class=\"keys\"><span>⌥</span><span>⌘</span><span>A</span></div><div class=\"ansbox\"><div class=\"ah\"><span class=\"dt\"></span>AI 回答</div><div class=\"q\">对基线有什么看法？</div><div class=\"a\">The baseline is solid, but it's tuned on a different split, so I'd rerun it on ours first.</div><div class=\"az on\">基线没问题，但调参用的是另一种划分，我会先在我们的数据上重跑一次。</div></div>": "<div class=\"caphud\"><div class=\"en\">So, any thoughts on the baseline?</div><div class=\"zh\" style=\"color:#bbb\">那麼，對基線有什麼看法？</div></div><div class=\"keys\"><span>⌥</span><span>⌘</span><span>A</span></div><div class=\"ansbox\"><div class=\"ah\"><span class=\"dt\"></span>AI 回答</div><div class=\"q\">對基線有什麼看法？</div><div class=\"a\">The baseline is solid, but it's tuned on a different split, so I'd rerun it on ours first.</div><div class=\"az on\">基線沒問題，但調參用的是另一種劃分，我會先在我們的資料上重跑一次。</div></div>",
