 "<div class=\"slidewin\"><div class=\"bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span style=\"margin-left:6px\">Machine Learning · 第 7 讲</span></div><h5>Gradient Descent</h5><p>Step size matters: too large oscillates, too small is slow.</p><svg class=\"cv\" viewBox=\"0 0 340 170\"><path d=\"M10 20 Q170 300 330 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5a5ff0\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M42 70L282 91L80 116L240 133L132 152L196 156\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f5883a\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/><g fill=\"#f5883a\"><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"70\" r=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"282\" cy=\"91\" r=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"116\" r=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"133\" r=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"132\" cy=\"152\" r=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"196\" cy=\"156\" r=\"5\"/></g></svg></div>\n        <div class=\"notes\"><div class=\"nh\"><span class=\"dt\"></span>实时笔记</div><div class=\"it h\">1. 梯度下降的直觉</div><div class=\"it\">· 沿着坡最陡的方向往下走</div><div class=\"it\">· 学习率太大会来回震荡</div><div class=\"it\">· 太小收敛很慢</div><div class=\"it ex\">★ 考点：学习率怎么选</div><div class=\"it h\">2. 收敛条件</div><div class=\"it\">· 损失不再下降就停</div></div>": "<div class=\"slidewin\"><div class=\"bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span style=\"margin-left:6px\">Machine Learning · 第 7 講</span></div><h5>Gradient Descent</h5><p>Step size matters: too large oscillates, too small is slow.</p><svg class=\"cv\" viewBox=\"0 0 340 170\"><path d=\"M10 20 Q170 300 330 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5a5ff0\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M42 70L282 91L80 116L240 133L132 152L196 156\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f5883a\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/><g fill=\"#f5883a\"><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"70\" r=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"282\" cy=\"91\" r=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"116\" r=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"133\" r=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"132\" cy=\"152\" r=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"196\" cy=\"156\" r=\"5\"/></g></svg></div>\n        <div class=\"notes\"><div class=\"nh\"><span class=\"dt\"></span>即時筆記</div><div class=\"it h\">1. 梯度下降的直覺</div><div class=\"it\">· 沿著坡最陡的方向往下走</div><div class=\"it\">· 學習率太大會來回震盪</div><div class=\"it\">· 太小收斂很慢</div><div class=\"it ex\">★ 考點：學習率怎麼選</div><div class=\"it h\">2. 收斂條件</div><div class=\"it\">· 損失不再下降就停</div></div>",
